    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Composition & project references",
      "items": [
        "Program.cs registers ILaptopRepository → InMemoryLaptopRepository and ILaptopService → LaptopService.",
        "API references Application and Infrastructure; Application references Domain.",
        "Infrastructure.csproj references Application, as currently authored; the runtime service call still targets the injected ILaptopRepository contract."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Request path",
      "items": [
        "LaptopsController calls LaptopService.GetLaptopsAsync(); the service calls GetAllAsync() and maps Laptop values to LaptopDto.",
        "The infrastructure repository owns and returns its seeded in-memory List<Laptop>; this is not a durable database."
      ]
    },
